<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on NW Infra.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on NW Infra.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched on Friday 99 million American-style third-party warrants on shares of New world Infrastructure Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$17.425	   PREMIUM	    9.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.5105	   GEARING	    4.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.NOV.97	   SETTLEMENT DATE  29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   4.DEC.96	    BOARD LOT	  2,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$20.65 NOTES: EXERCISE WILL BE FOR PHYSICAL SHARES AT ANY TIME FROM LISTING DATE TO MATURITY, OR IN CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
